---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
import { allQuestions, allPapers } from '../lib/data';
---
<Base title="About this site" context="about" description="Who runs alevelsociologytutor.com and where the questions, mark schemes and ratings come from.">
  <h1>About this site</h1>
  <p>alevelsociologytutor.com is run by {site.company}, an A-level tutoring business with a small team of specialist tutors. The site exists to give AQA sociology students the past-paper material they actually use, sorted the way they revise, free and without sign-up; and to introduce students who want more help to a tutor who teaches the AQA specification every week.</p>
  <h2>Where the material comes from</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Questions, mark schemes and examiner comments</strong> are from AQA's own published papers for every Sociology series since June 2016 (7192 A level and 7191 AS): {allPapers.length} papers and {allQuestions.length.toLocaleString()} question parts. Each part has been tagged to the specification statement it assesses, its assessment objectives and its question type. AQA no longer hosts the June 2016–2019 papers; those come from copies of AQA's original PDFs and are marked on the site.</li>
    <li><strong>Difficulty ratings</strong> are given only where an examiners' report prints the average mark on a question, which AQA's Sociology reports rarely do, so most parts are unrated.</li>
    <li><strong>Key-term cards and topic notes</strong> are written by our tutors and are original; nothing derived from AQA's material is generated automatically.</li>
    <li><strong>Grade boundaries and exam dates</strong> are AQA's published figures.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Who writes it</h2>
  <p>The tutoring is by Mark, a former AQA examiner with over 25 years of A-level Sociology teaching who leads a large sociology department; see the <a href="/tutors/">tutor page</a>. The site is built and maintained by the same small team that runs <a href="https://www.alevelbiologytutor.com" rel="noopener">alevelbiologytutor.com</a>, <a href="https://www.mathsaleveltutor.com" rel="noopener">mathsaleveltutor.com</a>, <a href="https://www.alevelpsychologytutor.com" rel="noopener">alevelpsychologytutor.com</a> and <a href="https://www.economicsaleveltutor.com" rel="noopener">economicsaleveltutor.com</a>.</p>
  <h2>Mistakes</h2>
  <p>If you find one, tell us on the <a href="/report/">report a mistake</a> page; corrections usually go live the same week.</p>
</Base>
